ndemic  affected those plans the games will  apparently run on the unreal engine and  the idea is for them to stay mostly true  to their ps2 era origins but with better  resolution and a new ui announcement at  the game awards i mean come on that'd be  pretty hype i can't lie  but okay to the most unsurprising news  of the day sony has acquired bluepoint  if you didn't know bluepoint is the  studio that developed the ps4 remake of  shadow of the colossus and most recently  developed the demon souls remake for  playstation 5. however don't expect them  to stay in the remake boat as it seems  their new project will be an original  one while speaking to ign blue point  president marco thrush said original  content is the next step in the studio's  evolution but he didn't say what the  project would be  but alright comment down below what you  want to see at the game awards remember  those rules and go check out some of our  new world content i've been working  pretty hard on it between live streams  and tip videos so if you're into the  game or just even a little bit curious  jump in check it out especially if  you're waiting online in a queue  [Applause]  [Music]  you
 

